RAJMUD 0.1.3

 *  Improves `ls` wiz command
 *  Makes `dest` work for items in inventory
 *  Adds a cooldown on searching (optional)
 *  Makes update work on current room without disconnecting
 *  Changes `who` command a bit
 *  Adds ringo beetle
 *  Adds header files for lib objects
 *  Adds autosaving
 *  Adds `delcompile` and `catcompile` commands for deleting and reading `/log/compile`
 *  Adds STD_RACE for making races
 *  Improves `living`. You can now create living objects and put them in rooms and they will be visible in `look` and `look at`
